From 1e8b220f900041c88344a9a6d3ada4cae6d0556b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Manish KL <manishklach@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 05:00:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] mm: hbf: add deadline-aware priority queue, hint merging,
 multi-node NUMA test

- Replace FIFO queue with deadline-sorted priority queue
  (entries without deadline go to tail; earliest-deadline-first ordering)
- Add admission-time deadline feasibility check using
  HBF_REJECT_DEADLINE_IMPOSSIBLE (was defined but unused)
- Add hint merge during submission: overlapping ranges with same mm,
  op, and target_nid are merged (widen range, keep tighter deadline)
- Switch from system_wq to unbound workqueue (WQ_UNBOUND | WQ_MEM_RECLAIM)
  for async request processing
- Wire up hbf_stat_inc_deadline_miss and other stats counters
- Change HBF_IOC_SUBMIT from _IOW to _IOWR (kernel writes request_id
  back to userspace)
---
